          "**Qualitative (categorical) data** are counted: **nominal** (no order - sex, blood group; two categories = dichotomous) and **ordinal** (ranked with unequal intervals - NYHA class, pain mild/moderate/severe, Likert scores). [Park 28e]",
          "**Quantitative (numerical) data** are measured: **discrete** (counts - parity, episodes of diarrhoea) and **continuous** (any value - height, haemoglobin, BP). [Park 28e]",
