          "**Normal distribution**: bell-shaped, defined by mean and SD, mean = median = mode - **68.3% within 1 SD, 95.4% within 2 SD (95% within 1.96 SD), 99.7% within 3 SD (99% within 2.58 SD)** - the basis of reference ranges. [Park 28e]",
