          "**Agreement**: **Cohen's kappa = (observed agreement - chance agreement) / (1 - chance agreement)**; Landis and Koch bands - 0.21-0.40 fair, 0.41-0.60 moderate, **0.61-0.80 substantial**, 0.81-1.00 almost perfect. [Park 28e]",
          "**Rates and ratios**: a **ratio** relates two separate quantities (sex ratio), a **proportion** has the numerator inside the denominator, and a **rate** adds time and a multiplier (per 1000 per year). [Park 28e]",
          "**Incidence** = new cases / population at risk over a period (risk); **prevalence** = all existing cases / population (burden); **prevalence = incidence x average duration** - a cure lowers prevalence without changing incidence. [Park 28e]",
