          "**Data display**: bar chart for nominal data (gaps), **histogram** for continuous data (no gaps, area = frequency), pie chart for parts of a whole, line graph for trends, scatter diagram for two continuous variables, spot map for place - with titled tables, labelled axes and a zero baseline. [Park 28e]",
