          "It was codified by the **RCGP in The Future General Practitioner (1972)**, rests on **Engel's biopsychosocial model (1977)**, and was made clinical by **McWhinney** and the patient-centred method. [McWhinney 4e]",
          "**Physical axis**: working diagnosis with severity and stage, complications, comorbidities, drugs and red flags. [Murtagh 8e]",
