          "Referral may also be **diagnostic** (for a test), **therapeutic** (for a procedure), **for opinion only**, or **community referral** to non-medical services (ASHA, anganwadi, one-stop centre, de-addiction centre, legal aid). [Oxford Handbook of General Practice 5e]",
