          "**Programme-mandated referrals**: drug-resistant TB to the nodal DR-TB centre, HIV to the ART centre, leprosy reactions, and **RBSK 4D children** (defects, diseases, deficiencies, developmental delays) to the District Early Intervention Centre. [NTEP 2024]",
